      "gist": "You told me you were stepping outside for the harbor ledger and would return soon. Even with that reassurance, I felt cold with fear and asked you not to vanish.",
      "detail": "My stomach went cold as I said, \"Please do not vanish.\"",
      "feeling": "Exposed need beneath my guardedness.",
